"<section class=\"d-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"desktop-title\" data-testid=\"desktop-hero\"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"eyebrow eyebrow--pill d-hero__eyebrow enter\" style=\"--d:0\">SoraFiles Desktop · Windows, macOS and Linux</p><h1 id=\"desktop-title\" class=\"t-h1 d-hero__title\" data-testid=\"desktop-title\"><span class=\"line-reveal\"><span class=\"line-reveal__inner\" style=\"--i:0\">File tools, right where </span></span><span class=\"line-reveal\"><span class=\"line-reveal__inner\" style=\"--i:1\">your files are.</span></span></h1><p class=\"t-lead d-hero__lead enter\" style=\"--d:1\">A native app for people who work with PDFs and images often. Select files, right-click, choose a tool.</p><div class=\"d-hero__actions enter\" style=\"--d:2\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" data-testid=\"desktop-hero-download\" href=\"/desktop/download\" data-discover=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download btn__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15V3\"></path><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"btn__label\">Download</span></a><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--lg\" data-testid=\"desktop-hero-plans\" href=\"/desktop/pricing\" data-discover=\"true\"><span class=\"btn__label\">View plans</span></a></div><p class=\"t-caption d-hero__note enter\" style=\"--d:3\" data-testid=\"desktop-trial-note\">Includes a 7-day free trial.</p></div></section><section id=\"how-it-works\" class=\"demo\" aria-labelledby=\"demo-title\" data-testid=\"workflow-demo\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 id=\"demo-title\" class=\"visually-hidden\">How SoraFiles Desktop works</h2><div class=\"demo__grid\"><div class=\"fm\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-phase=\"idle\" data-testid=\"demo-file-manager\"><div class=\"fm__bar\"><s