-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-image\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"m20 17-1.296-1.296a2.41 2.41 0 0 0-3.408 0L9 22\"></path></svg><span class=\"fm-row__label tnum\">Receipt-March.jpg</span></span><span class=\"fm-row__size tnum\">3.1 MB</span><span class=\"fm-row__kind\">JPEG image</span></div></div><div class=\"fm__group\"><div class=\"fm-row\" data-testid=\"demo-row-notes\"><span class=\"fm-row__name\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><span class=\"fm-row__label tnum\">Notes.docx</span></span><span class=\"fm-row__size tnum\">142 KB</span><span class=\"fm-row__kind\">Word document</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"fm__status\" data-testid=\"demo-status\">5 items</div><div class=\"ctx-menu fm__menu\" data-open=\"false\"><span class=\"ctx-menu__item\">Open</span><span class=\"ctx-menu__item\">Rename</span><span class=\"ctx-menu__item\">Copy</span><span class=\"ctx-menu__sep\"></span><span class=\"ctx-menu__item\"><svg class=\"logo-mark\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path class=\"logo-mark__sky\" d=\"M18.5 4H26a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v6.75a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7.75A10.75 10.75 0 0 1 18.5 4z\"></path><path class=\"logo-mark__file\" d=\"M6 17.25h18.25A10.75 10.75 0 0 1 13.5 28H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-6.75a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"></path></svg>Edit with SoraFiles<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right ctx-menu__chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></span></div><div class=\"ctx-menu fm__sub\" data-open=\"false\"><span class=\"ctx-menu__item\">Compress PDF</span><span class=\"ctx-menu__item\">Merge PDF</span><span class=\"ctx-menu__item\">Rotate PDF</span><span class=\"ctx-menu__item\">PDF to JPG</span></div></div><div class=\"demo__side\"><ol class=\"demo-steps\" data-testid=\"demo-steps\"><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"demo-step\" aria-current=\"step\" data-testid=\"demo-step-1\"><span class=\"demo-step__num tnum\">01</span><span class=\"demo-step__body\"><span class=\"demo-step__title\">Select</span><span class=\"demo-step__text\">Pick one file or a batch in your file manager.</span></span></button></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"demo-step\" data-testid=\"demo-step-2\"><span class=\"demo-step__num tnum\">02</span><span class=\"demo-step__body\"><span class=\"demo-step__title\">Right-click</span><span class=\"demo-step__text\">Choose Edit with SoraFiles.</span></span></button></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"demo-step\" data-testid=\"demo-step-3\"><span class=\"demo-step__num tnum\">03</span><span class=\"demo-step__body\"><span class=\"demo-step__title\">Pick an action</span><span class=\"demo-step__text\">For example, Compress PDF.</span></span></button></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"demo-step\" data-testid=\"demo-step-4\"><span class=\"demo-step__num tnum\">04</span><span class=\"demo-step__body\"><span class=\"demo-step__title\">Done</span><span class=\"demo-step__text\">New files are saved beside the originals.</span></span></button></li></ol><div class=\"demo__controls\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm\" data-testid=\"demo-play-toggle\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-pause btn__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"14\" y=\"4\" width=\"4\" height=\"16\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"6\" y=\"4\" width=\"4\" height=\"16\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg><span class=\"btn__label\">Pause</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn--tertiary btn--sm\" data-testid=\"demo-replay\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rotate-ccw btn__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"></path><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"></path></svg><span class=\"btn__label\">Replay</span></button></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"benefits\" aria-labelledby=\"benefits-title\" data-testid=\"desktop-benefits\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 id=\"benefits-title\" class=\"visually-hidden\">Why Desktop</h2><ul class=\"reveal benefits__list\" data-inview=\"false\"><li class=\"benefit\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers benefit__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"t-h3\">Less repetition</h3><p class=\"t-small\">Batch actions and file-manager shortcuts keep repeat tasks close to your files.</p></li><li class=\"benefit\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-open benefit__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 14 1.5-2.9A2 2 0 0 1 9.24 10H20a2 2 0 0 1 1.94 2.5l-1.54 6a2 2 0 0 1-1.95 1.5H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H18a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"t-h3\">Saved beside the originals</h3><p class=\"t-small\">New copies land next to the source files, or in another folder you choose.</p></li><li class=\"benefit\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-laptop benefit__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 5a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8.526a2 2 0 0 0 .212.897l1.068 2.127a1 1 0 0 1-.9 1.45H3.62a1 1 0 0 1-.9-1.45l1.068-2.127A2 2 0 0 0 4 15.526V7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M20.054 15.987H3.946\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"t-h3\">Processed on your computer</h3><p class=\"t-small\">Supported workflows run on this device. Payment and licensing are separate from your files.</p></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"section platforms\" aria-labelledby=\"platforms-title\" data-testid=\"desktop-platforms\"><div class=\"reveal container platforms__grid\" data-inview=\"false\"><div><h2 id=\"platforms-title\" class=\"t-h2\">Windows, macOS and Linux.</h2><p class=\"t-lead platforms__offline\" data-testid=\"desktop-offline-line\">Works offline after setup.</p></div><ul class=\"platforms__list\"><li><a class=\"platform\" data-testid=\"platform-windows\" href=\"/desktop/download\" data-discover=\"true\"><span class=\"platform__name\">Windows</span><span class=\"platform__meta\">Installer and checksum<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></a></li><li><a class=\"platform\" data-testid=\"platform-macos\" href=\"/desktop/download\" data-discover=\"true\"><span class=\"platform__name\">macOS</span><span class=\"platform__meta\">Installer and checksum<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></a></li><li><a class=\"platform\" data-testid=\"platform-linux\" href=\"/desktop/download\" data-discover=\"true\"><span class=\"platform__name\">Linux</span><span class=\"platform__meta\">Installer and checksum<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></a></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"section section--ruled compare\" aria-labelledby=\"compare-title\" data-testid=\"desktop-comparison\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"reveal \" data-inview=\"false\"><h2 id=\"compare-title\" class=\"t-h2\">Web or Desktop?</h2><table class=\"compare__table\"><thead><tr><td></td><th scope=\"col\">SoraFiles Web</th><th scope=\"col\">SoraFiles Desktop</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Cost</th><td data-label=\"Web\">Free</td><td data-label=\"Desktop\">Paid app</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Installation</th><td data-label=\"Web\">None, runs in your browser</td><td data-label=\"Desktop\">Installer for Windows, macOS or Linux</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">File-manager actions</th><td data-label=\"Web\">Open files in a web tool</td><td data-label=\"Desktop\">Right-click actions, where the platform build supports them</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Updates</th><td data-label=\"Web\">Release notes for every version</td><td data-label=\"Desktop\">Release notes for every version</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"compare__note\">SoraFiles Web stays free. <a class=\"link compare__link\" data-testid=\"compare-web-tools-link\" href=\"/tools\" data-discover=\"true\">Open the web tools<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></p></div></div></section><section class=\"final-cta\" aria-labelledby=\"cta-title\" data-testid=\"desktop-final-cta\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"reveal final-cta__panel on-dark\" data-inview=\"false\"><h2 id=\"cta-title\" class=\"t-h1\">Start your 7-day trial.</h2><p class=\"t-lead final-cta__text\">Installers and checksums are listed on the Downloads page.</p><div class=\"final-cta__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" data-testid=\"cta-download\" href=\"/desktop/download\" data-discover=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download btn__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15V3\"></path><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"btn__label\">Download</span></a><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--lg\" data-testid=\"cta-plans\" href=\"/desktop/pricing\" data-discover=\"true\"><span class=\"btn__label\">View plans</span></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section section--ruled faq\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\" data-testid=\"desktop-faq\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"faq__grid\"><h2 id=\"faq-title\" class=\"t-h2\">Questions</h2><div class=\"faq__list\"><div class=\"faq__item\" data-open=\"true\"><h3><button type=\"button\" id=\"faq-q-0\" class=\"faq__q\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-a-0\" data-testid=\"faq-question-0\">Is SoraFiles Web still free?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></button></h3><div id=\"faq-a-0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-q-0\" class=\"faq__panel\" data-testid=\"faq-answer-0\"><div><p>Yes. The web app stays free and keeps getting fixes and improvements. You don’t need Desktop to use sorafiles.com.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-open=\"false\"><h3><button type=\"button\" id=\"faq-q-1\" class=\"faq__q\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-a-1\" data-testid=\"faq-question-1\">Does Desktop upload my files?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></button></h3><div id=\"faq-a-1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-q-1\" class=\"faq__panel\" data-testid=\"faq-answer-1\"><div><p>No. Supported Desktop workflows process files on your computer. Payment and licensing are handled separately from file processing.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-open=\"false\"><h3><button type=\"button\" id=\"faq-q-2\" class=\"faq__q\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-a-2\" data-testid=\"faq-question-2\">Does it work offline?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></button></h3><div id=\"faq-a-2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-q-2\" class=\"faq__panel\" data-testid=\"faq-answer-2\"><div><p>Yes. After setup, Desktop keeps working without an internet connection.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-open=\"false\"><h3><button type=\"button\" id=\"faq-q-3\" class=\"faq__q\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-a-3\" data-testid=\"faq-question-3\">How many devices does a license cover?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></button></h3><div id=\"faq-a-3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-q-3\" class=\"faq__panel\" data-testid=\"faq-answer-3\"><div><p>Personal covers one active device. Team covers up to five.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-open=\"false\"><h3><button type=\"button\" id=\"faq-q-4\" class=\"faq__q\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-a-4\" data-testid=\"faq-question-4\">How does the trial work?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg></button></h3><div id=\"faq-a-4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-q-4\" class=\"faq__panel\" data-testid=\"faq-answer-4\"><div><p>Your 7-day trial starts when you first open SoraFiles Desktop on Windows, macOS or Linux. Connect to finish setup; waiting to connect does not extend the trial. When it ends, processing needs a valid license; settings stay available.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>"
